 "intro": {
  "@es": "Cuando el verbo principal está en pasado y algo es anterior a ese pasado, usas el congiuntivo trapassato. Es como decir «pensaba que habías terminado».",
  "@en": "When the main verb is in the past and something is prior to that past, you use the congiuntive trapassate. It's like saying «I thought you were done.»."
 }
